</code></pre> <p>The snippet reads the signer's private key from the <code>SIGNER_PRIVATE_KEY</code> environment variable, which defaults to a test key if not set. The signer's address is derived from the public key.</p> <p>In this tutorial, the signer adds metadata to their own account. Adding metadata to a different account requires the target to cosign the transaction.</p>

